# Grafted Wargear: "Whenever this Equipment becomes unattached from a permanent, sacrifice that permanent." Only the Wargear's
# own unattaching counts. Bot1 equips the Wargear to the first Llanowar Elves on turn 1. On turn 3 it equips a Lavaspur Boots
# to a second Elves and then moves the Boots to the first one, so the Boots becomes unattached from the second Elves, which
# is not sacrificed. Both Elves survive.

